---
title: Account Transaction Processing
---
sequenceDiagram
  %% Generated by 6_diagram agent — sequence-builder skill
  %% Entry point: BCHCTL00 batch control

  participant JCL as Batch Job
  participant CTRL as BCHCTL00
  participant PROC as PRCSEQ00
  participant DB as DB2
  participant ERR as ERRPROC

  JCL->>CTRL: Execute
  Note over CTRL: Start batch processing
  
  CTRL->>PROC: Call transaction processor
  PROC->>DB: SELECT transactions
  loop For each transaction
    PROC->>DB: Validate amount
    alt Amount OK
      PROC->>DB: INSERT/UPDATE
    else Error
      PROC->>ERR: Log error
      ERR-->>PROC: Return
    end
  end
  
  PROC-->>CTRL: Return status
  CTRL->>DB: COMMIT
  CTRL->>CTRL: End job
